{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/UnslothAI/status/2100601458458804381","id":"2100601458458804381","text":"You can now train and run 500+ models locally with our Unsloth Docker image! 🐳\n\nUse our new GUI or notebooks workflow. No setup required. Works on NVIDIA and AMD.\n\nGuide: https://unsloth.ai/docs/get-started/install/docker\nGitHub: https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth","raw_text":{"text":"You can now train and run 500+ models locally with our Unsloth Docker image! 🐳\n\nUse our new GUI or notebooks workflow. No setup required. Works on NVIDIA and AMD.\n\nGuide: https://t.co/ER5lOLGQa5\nGitHub: https://t.co/aZWYAtakBP https://t.co/CJ8Wk9iWbV","display_text_range":[0,226],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[171,194],"original":"https://t.co/ER5lOLGQa5","replacement":"https://unsloth.ai/docs/get-started/install/docker","display":"unsloth.ai/docs/get-start…"},{"type":"url","indices":[203,226],"original":"https://t.co/aZWYAtakBP","replacement":"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth","display":"github.com/unslothai/unsl…"},{"type":"media","indices":[227,250],"id":"2100601199154352129","display":"pic.x.com/CJ8Wk9iWbV","original":"https://t.co/CJ8Wk9iWbV","replacement":"https://x.com/UnslothAI/status/2100601458458804381/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"UnslothAI","url":"https://x.com/UnslothAI","id":"1730159888402395136","followers":99537,"following":479,"likes":14932,"media_count":288,"name":"Unsloth AI","description":"Run and train models locally with the Unsloth Desktop app. 🦥 https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth","raw_description":{"text":"Run and train models locally with the Unsloth Desktop app. 🦥 https://t.co/2kXqhhvdCD","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[61,84],"original":"https://t.co/2kXqhhvdCD","replacement":"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth","display":"github.com/unslothai/unsl…"}]},"location":"San Francisco, CA","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1730159888402395136/1755305669","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036313340616777728/OLALWB2__200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Nov 30 09:40:46 +0000 2023","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http://unsloth.ai","display_url":"unsloth.ai"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"organization"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":23,"retweets":99,"likes":704,"bookmarks":411,"quotes":9,"created_at":"Thu Sep 17 15:03:09 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1789657389,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":55151,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","id":"2100601199154352129","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSbVqUJa0AElYmf.jpg?name=orig","width":3724,"height":4096}],"photos":[{"type":"photo","id":"2100601199154352129","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSbVqUJa0AElYmf.jpg?name=orig","width":3724,"height":4096}]},"quote":{"url":"https://x.com/UnslothAI/status/2087177146662072546","id":"2087177146662072546","text":"Introducing Unsloth Desktop 🦥\nThe first desktop app to run and train models locally.\n\n• Open-source. Runs on Mac, Windows and Linux\n• Supports MLX, diffusion image/video, audio, GGUF\n• Connect Claude Code and Codex to local LLMs\n• 50% more accurate, self-healing tool calls + sandboxed code exec\n• Works for CPU + multiGPU setups - NVIDIA, AMD, Intel, Mac\n• Train models 2× faster with 70% less VRAM\n• Private web search, deep research, RAG, MCP and exports (NVFP4, GGUF)\n• Use Unsloth’s OpenAI-compatible API and cloud models\n• Securely deploy LLMs remotely and access anywhere\n\nUnsloth Desktop is now available on http://unsloth.ai and GitHub.\n\nGitHub: https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth\nBlog and Guide: https://unsloth.ai/docs/desktop","raw_text":{"text":"Introducing Unsloth Desktop 🦥\nThe first desktop app to run and train models locally.\n\n• Open-source. Runs on Mac, Windows and Linux\n• Supports MLX, diffusion image/video, audio, GGUF\n• Connect Claude Code and Codex to local LLMs\n• 50% more accurate, self-healing tool calls + sandboxed code exec\n• Works for CPU + multiGPU setups - NVIDIA, AMD, Intel, Mac\n• Train models 2× faster with 70% less VRAM\n• Private web search, deep research, RAG, MCP and exports (NVFP4, GGUF)\n• Use Unsloth’s OpenAI-compatible API and cloud models\n• Securely deploy LLMs remotely and access anywhere\n\nUnsloth Desktop is now available on https://t.co/xxBDOI9ApK and GitHub.\n\nGitHub: https://t.co/2kXqhhvLsb\nBlog and Guide: https://t.co/CYosNAQHva","display_text_range":[0,725],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[276,299],"id":"2087174761277538304","display":"pic.x.com/vjTFB1e5IQ","original":"https://t.co/vjTFB1e5IQ","replacement":"https://x.com/UnslothAI/status/2087177146662072546/video/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[616,639],"original":"https://t.co/xxBDOI9ApK","replacement":"http://unsloth.ai","display":"unsloth.ai"},{"type":"url","indices":[661,684],"original":"https://t.co/2kXqhhvLsb","replacement":"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth","display":"github.com/unslothai/unsl…"},{"type":"url","indices":[701,724],"original":"https://t.co/CYosNAQHva","replacement":"https://unsloth.ai/docs/desktop","display":"unsloth.ai/docs/desktop"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"UnslothAI","url":"https://x.com/UnslothAI","id":"1730159888402395136","followers":99537,"following":479,"likes":14932,"media_count":288,"name":"Unsloth AI","description":"Run and train models locally with the Unsloth Desktop app. 🦥 https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth","raw_description":{"text":"Run and train models locally with the Unsloth Desktop app. 🦥 https://t.co/2kXqhhvdCD","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[61,84],"original":"https://t.co/2kXqhhvdCD","replacement":"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth","display":"github.com/unslothai/unsl…"}]},"location":"San Francisco, CA","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1730159888402395136/1755305669","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036313340616777728/OLALWB2__200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Nov 3